# {{ plugin_name }} 插件国际化

> 复制到 `.astrbot-plugin/i18n/zh-CN.json` 与 `en-US.json`（文件名用 WebUI 的 locale）。改完需要**重载插件**才生效。
> 顶层三块：`metadata`（插件名/描述）、`config`（配置项文案，键与 `_conf_schema.json` 对齐）、`views`（视图标题与页面文案，键与 `views/` 目录名一致）。

## zh-CN.json

{
  "metadata": {
    "display_name": "{{ display_name }}",
    "short_desc": "一句话介绍",
    "desc": "详细描述"
  },
  "config": {
    "timeout": {
      "description": "超时时间（秒）",
      "hint": "超过该时长未响应即判定失败并重试"
    }
  },
  "views": {
    "example": {
      "title": "示例视图",
      "description": "演示插件视图如何通过 bridge 调用后端",
      "hint": "页面通过 bridge 调用插件后端，不要用裸 fetch。"
    }
  }
}

## en-US.json

{
  "metadata": {
    "display_name": "{{ display_name }}",
    "short_desc": "One-line intro",
    "desc": "Detailed description"
  },
  "config": {
    "timeout": {
      "description": "Timeout (seconds)",
      "hint": "Treat the request as failed and retry when it exceeds this duration"
    }
  },
  "views": {
    "example": {
      "title": "Example view",
      "description": "Shows how a plugin view calls the backend through the bridge",
      "hint": "Call the plugin backend through the bridge, not with bare fetch."
    }
  }
}
